+ * at the end of a scene render and sends them at its next flush (the next render's first clear, or EndScene), by when
+ * the next eye's texture is bound. vr_d3d_spill says where those late draws belong: 1 nowhere (the camera pass), 2 the
+ * eye texture just finished (with its view mapping). It lasts until the next Clear, SetRenderTarget, EndScene or
+ * Present, and moves only depth-tested draws (the weapon; not 2D overlays). vr_gun_cull_flip: the weapon is mirrored
